   "image": "solder.jpg",
   "excerpt": "Ines Duarte teaches soldering to developers at a Lisbon hackerspace. She says the fear is the hardest part and the flux is the second.",
   "date": "2026-08-13",
   "content": "<!-- wp:audio -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-audio\"><audio controls src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5e/Ada_Lovelace_%28As_Told_By_U.S._Chief_Technology_Officer_Megan_Smith%29.mp3\"></audio><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Stand-in audio: “Ada Lovelace”, told by Megan Smith for the White House (public domain). Replace with your episode file.</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:audio -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Chapters</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"is-style-chapters\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list is-style-chapters\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5e/Ada_Lovelace_%28As_Told_By_U.S._Chief_Technology_Officer_Megan_Smith%29.mp3#t=0\">0:00</a> Intro</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5e/Ada_Lovelace_%28As_Told_By_U.S._Chief_Technology_Officer_Megan_Smith%29.mp3#t=360\">6:00</a> The first joint</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5e/Ada_Lovelace_%28As_Told_By_U.S._Chief_Technology_Officer_Megan_Smith%29.mp3#t=1500\">25:00</a> Kits that are worth it</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5e/Ada_Lovelace_%28As_Told_By_U.S._Chief_Technology_Officer_Megan_Smith%29.mp3#t=2300\">38:20</a> Burns, briefly</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Show notes</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Added</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"is-style-diff-added\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list is-style-diff-added\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ines’s starter kit list, all under €60.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-panel\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-x-small-font-size\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"600\"}},\"textColor\":\"muted\",\"fontSize\":\"x-small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-muted-color has-text-color has-x-small-font-size\" style=\"font-weight:600\">Guest</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Ines Duarte</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hardware engineer. Runs a Thursday soldering night in Lisbon.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->"
